// the amount due, duo-aware (mirrors AdminAddStudentAsync) — growing a PRIVATE
// booking to 2 seats bills the flat duo rate, not 2x the drop-in. Without this,
// resizing a cash Private booking up to duo (e.g. via "Make it a Duo Class" at
// checkout) would overcharge the client. Credit bookings stay 0đ due — the
